cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use cesm-hawc in published work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "cesm-hawc"
abstract: >-
  Simulates what the Aerosol Limb Imager (ALI) on the HAWC satellite would
  observe and retrieve for CESM2/WACCM model atmospheres, by converting WACCM
  columns and MAM4 sulfate aerosol into inputs for the HAWC ALI simulator.
authors:
